        },
        "description": "An enthusiastic young girl, and one of the protagonists, though she does not appear to have an animal partner. Her body is extremely strong, enough to do a hundred push-ups with Amamiya on her back or destroy a golem in one blow. She wants to save the Earth from the Biscuit Hammer, but her reason for doing so is so she can eventually destroy the world herself.    ~!Later on, she admits her love to Yuuhi. !~",
        "gender": "Female",
