        },
        "description": "Another one of the humans who made a contract with an animal partner.  He introduces himself as a \"Hero of Justice\", and even carries a card.  In battle, he's far more skilled than Amamiya or Asahina.  His partner is Ludo Shubarie, the Dog Knight, and his ability, Houtengeki, is an invisible energy spear.   ~!He is killed in chapter 14.!~",
